hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15747","Affan narrated to us, Aban narrated to us, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir narrated to us, from Zayd, from Abu Sallam, from a freedman of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Bravo, bravo, five, how heavy they are in the scale: There is no god but Allah, and Allah is Greatest, and glory be to Allah, and all praise is due to Allah, and a righteous child who dies and his parents seek reward for him. And he said: Bravo, bravo, for five: whoever meets Allah certain of them will enter Paradise: he believes in Allah, and the Last Day, and Paradise, and the Fire, and resurrection after death, and reckoning."
